        "verified": true,
        "how": "Fixed versions 8.5.12/8.4.27/8.3.36/8.2.35 match experiment.md and were cross-checked on 2026-10-26 against GHSA-6wmf-4rv5-p3rp 'Patched versions', the php.net 2026 news archive, the PHP Foundation post and CERT-EU 2026-018. Branches <= 8.1 are EOL and get no upstream fix (CERT-EU). Affected SAPIs: advisories describe mod_php (unauthenticated, default settings) and PHP-FPM (via app code paths); CLI is reported for completeness. Distro backported fixes are modelled by distro_package_fixed rows sourced from the Ubuntu, Debian, Red Hat and Rocky trackers and the Alpine secdb on 2026-10-26. Gaps (no tracker row in definitions): RHEL php:8.2/8.3 module NEVRAs (RHSA-2026:87072/87079/87073/87080 exist but the NEVRA was not copied), RHEL9 php:8.4 still 'Affected' with no fix, AlmaLinux/CentOS/Oracle not sourced, Ubuntu 18.04 and older ESM-only, Alpine 3.20 and older have no secdb entry (upstream comparison is used for Alpine)."
      },
