        "verified": true,
        "how": "Fingerprints copied from Mozilla bug 2083709 and matched against Debian 12/Ubuntu 24.04/Alpine 3.20/Rocky 9 bundle copies on 2026-10-26. eMudhra and the bug say no TLS server certs were issued under these roots, so this is low urgency hygiene. Fixed distro ca-certificates versions not verified. Re-checked 2026-10-26 in the CCADB Mozilla 'Removed CA Certificate Report': both fingerprints match, removal bug 2083709, NSS 3.131. kind=ca_info: findings are reported as NOTE/INFO and never change the host verdict or exit code."
      },
      "rules": [
        {
          "type": "cert_fingerprint_present",
          "stores": [
            "os_ca",
            "certifi",
            "java",
